      "answerText": "2n + 2k = 2(n + k)",
      "solution": [
        "Write a = 2n and b = 2k.",
        "a + b = 2n + 2k = 2(n + k).",
        "This has the form 2m, so it is even."
      ],
      "langType": "§4 ex. 1"
    },
